# Issue: the built-in Add rules rebuilt a cancelled numeric sum from a bag
# of terms listed in Type's Ord, which compares type variables by Id, that
# is by string-intern order; the solved width came back as m + n in one
# compile and n + m in another, and that type reached the .bo.
# Fix: fromAddTerms orders the terms by cmpTypeShape, by content alone.
# Pull request: https://github.com/MatX-inc/bsc/pull/188
# The probe zero-extends one bit to n + (m + 2) bits, alone and behind a
# scrambler that interns m before n; the two .bo dumps must be identical.

batching_bo_pair NumOrder.bsv NumOrderRoot.bsv NumOrderScramble.bsv
